WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:39.770
<b>The Execution Platform</b>

3
00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:49.880
Yeah! Ace is alive!

4
00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:52.240
Hey, stay with me!

5
00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:55.110
Was that Ace's brother?!

6
00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:56.470
Look at this!

7
00:02:56.470 --> 00:02:58.480
I almost passed out!

8
00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:08.070
Like Pops and Red Hair
he used Conqueror's Haki!

9
00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.170
Was he the one who did it?

10
00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:15.570
Seems like he used it unconsciously.

11
00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:19.540
I didn't know that he had
such tremendous power!

12
00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:30.060
He was born with it as I thought!

13
00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:32.060
He uses it, too!

14
00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:35.230
Back down if your heart is weak!

15
00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:37.930
He is not just another rookie!

16
00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:40.080
Conqueror's Haki!

17
00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:44.950
But it's not surprising because he's
the son of Dragon the revolutionary!

18
00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:46.170
Vice Admiral Doberman!

19
00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:50.340
Hey, where did you get the power from?!

20
00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:52.010
Huh?! What power?!

21
00:03:52.010 --> 00:03:54.070
Never mind!

22
00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:55.800
He's not aware of it!

23
00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:57.800
So it's not ready to be used!

24
00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:00.320
But it's no wonder that he attracts people!

25
00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:04.110
This is why they say "blood will tell," Dragon!

26
00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:12.760
Don't let him escape this battlefield! If
you do, he'll prove a formidable foe for us!

27
00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:14.770
Make sure he dies!

28
00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:22.370
Let's get Whitebeard first!

29
00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:27.780
He's a monster but he's wounded
badly! Bring him down at any cost!

30
00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:32.480
You guys!

31
00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:33.490
Pops?!

32
00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:39.290
From now on, back Straw Hat Luffy up...

33
00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:43.850
with all your strength!

34
00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:53.870
Ace's brother?!

35
00:04:55.610 --> 00:04:58.480
Straw Hat-boy! Watch out!

36
00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:03.820
You're...

37
00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:07.880
the allied pirate of Whitebeard, Bohemian Knight Doma!

38
00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:10.880
Nice to meet you, Vice Admiral Momonga!

39
00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:18.980
DeCalvan Brothers!

40
00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:20.390
You got to fight...!

41
00:05:20.390 --> 00:05:21.900
Against us!

42
00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:25.080
Thunder Lord McGuy!

43
00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:28.770
I need you to fight me,
Vice Admiral Doberman!

44
00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:32.110
I-Is this...?!

45
00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:35.780
We pirates from the New World will assist you!

46
00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:39.420
Ace-chan's right there! Let's go, Straw Hat!

47
00:05:43.490 --> 00:05:46.860
The allied pirates of Whitebeard
are surrounding Straw Hat!

48
00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:53.470
What are they doing?!

49
00:05:53.470 --> 00:05:55.500
Hurry up, Ace's brother!

50
00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:58.810
Navy forces are focusing on Pops now!

51
00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:01.970
This is your only chance
to get beyond the admirals!

52
00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:05.340
Let's break through all
at once! Come with us!

53
00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:10.740
This is a big deal, Straw Hat-boy!

54
00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:13.670
The world's greatest pirate
is putting you to the test!

55
00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:14.120
Huh?

56
00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.100
Heehaw!

57
00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:20.860
Whitebeard put all his hopes
on you! That's a big thing!

58
00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:25.530
Are you ready to respond
to his expectations?!

59
00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:29.970
I don't know what Whitebeard wants!

60
00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:32.300
But I came here for...

61
00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:37.010
only one reason, right from the start!

62
00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:39.040
The pirates are gaining vigor!

63
00:06:39.430 --> 00:06:42.310
They're gonna break through!
We need more troops!

64
00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:45.040
Vice Admiral-dono! Let's
get Straw Hat first...!

65
00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:45.920
Wait!

66
00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:50.660
They left Whitebeard alone!
Attack Whitebeard now!

67
00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:54.350
If we can bring Whitebeard
down, we can stop all of them!

68
00:06:56.050 --> 00:07:01.230
They think that they can beat me
if they attack me all at one time!

69
00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:18.250
Whitebeard! Is he invincible?!

70
00:07:20.850 --> 00:07:23.190
Do it, brat!

71
00:07:23.190 --> 00:07:27.930
You just stopped them from
executing Ace on my behalf!

72
00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:31.310
You have the middle initial D,

73
00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:36.230
so show me how the world
will be in years to come!

74
00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:38.470
That's...

75
00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:40.040
Hawk Eye!

76
00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:44.000
Heads up, Straw Hat-boy!

77
00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:47.450
What are you...?!

78
00:07:47.970 --> 00:07:52.280
It's the president's order! We consider
the Navy as our enemy for now! Go!

79
00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:56.820
You're Daz Bones, aren't you?

80
00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:05.860
Straw Hat-boy!

81
00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:17.110
Crocodile!

82
00:08:18.690 --> 00:08:21.080
You're sleeping too much, Mr. 1!

83
00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:25.350
I got out of shape by being in prison.

84
00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:30.290
I don't need you here, Straw Hat! Off you go!

85
00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:38.330
Why are you standing in my way, Crocodile?

86
00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:42.110
I'm not in the best mood now.

87
00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:44.870
So you better watch yourself, Hawk Eye!

88
00:08:48.050 --> 00:08:49.110
Luffy!

89
00:08:49.540 --> 00:08:53.340
I want to help you, too!

90
00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:57.850
Shoot Monkey D. Luffy.

91
00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:11.300
Boa Hancock. Friendly operative. Abort attack.

92
00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:12.720
Hey!

93
00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:19.250
What do you think you're doing?!

94
00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:22.670
You're a Warlord, aren't you, Boa Hancock?!

95
00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:25.410
Why do you keep stopping the Pacifistas?!

96
00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:27.850
I thought you were on the Government's side!

97
00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:33.820
You're such a senseless man!
You don't know anything!

98
00:09:34.230 --> 00:09:35.220
What?!

99
00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:38.100
Let me tell you one thing.

100
00:09:38.730 --> 00:09:41.660
Love is always a hurricane!

101
00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:43.770
What're you talking about?!

102
00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:49.630
The scaffold is close now, Straw Hat-boy!

103
00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:52.440
You just run straight!

104
00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:53.590
Alright!

105
00:09:56.050 --> 00:09:58.940
Now is our chance to do it.

106
00:10:00.050 --> 00:10:03.430
I'm sorry that you must do this when you're
not fully recovered.

107
00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:05.880
But we need you!

108
00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:08.980
It's nothing, Iva-san.

109
00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:11.660
Don't worry about it.

110
00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:21.170
Crab-chan!

111
00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:46.790
What is that?!

112
00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:49.970
Inazuma of the Revolutionary Army! He did it!

113
00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:52.430
There's a bridge! Alright!

114
00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:56.130
Straw Hat is heading straight towards the scaffold!

115
00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:58.450
Do something or he'll reach it!

116
00:10:58.450 --> 00:11:00.470
Don't let him!

117
00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:04.340
We can't! These pirates aren't letting us by!

118
00:11:04.340 --> 00:11:08.010
Gah! Use guns! Fire at Straw Hat!

119
00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:24.860
What?! Th-They are...

120
00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:29.490
commanders of the Whitebeard Pirates!

121
00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:37.000
Ace's brother! Just run straight, don't stop!

122
00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:43.010
Break through all at once!

123
00:11:57.620 --> 00:11:59.230
Don't let him pass through!

124
00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:01.480
Rubber-Rubber...

125
00:12:02.730 --> 00:12:06.180
...Battle Axe!

126
00:12:12.180 --> 00:12:13.800
Luffy-kun, go ahead!

127
00:12:13.800 --> 00:12:15.680
Alright, thanks!

128
00:12:16.930 --> 00:12:19.290
Don't let him go!

129
00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:21.990
Death Wink!

130
00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:27.670
No one will pass by here!

131
00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:32.800
Just advance, Straw Hat-boy!

132
00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:35.190
Straw Hat will make it!

133
00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:37.700
Yeah! Keep going!

134
00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:40.870
Yank Straw Hat down!

135
00:12:40.870 --> 00:12:43.410
Go, Straw Hat!

136
00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:45.540
Set Ace free!

137
00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:51.550
I can't believe that you used that
kid as a trump card, Whitebeard!

138
00:12:51.550 --> 00:12:54.650
But I won't let him go any further!

139
00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:04.960
Whitebeard!

140
00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:08.770
Why don't you stay quiet and watch?

141
00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:23.120
Luffy!

142
00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:29.250
I'm here, Ace!

143
00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:47.950
It's Garp the Hero!

144
00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:52.680
Grandpa! Move out of my way!

145
00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:55.400
I'm not going to move!

146
00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:58.950
Because I'm a vice admiral of the Navy!

147
00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:05.390
I've been fighting against pirates
since long before you were born!

148
00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:07.360
Gramps!

149
00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:14.630
If you wanna pass through here,
you have to kill me first!

150
00:14:15.210 --> 00:14:17.350
Straw Hat Luffy!

151
00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:22.840
Because of the path you two...

152
00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:26.890
have chosen to live!

153
00:14:32.210 --> 00:14:36.950
You gotta find a way, Straw Hat-boy!
Hurry up before the bridge collapses!

154
00:14:36.950 --> 00:14:38.660
Straw Hat!

155
00:14:39.240 --> 00:14:40.560
Luffy-kun!

156
00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:48.700
Ouch!

157
00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:55.190
You bastard!

158
00:15:02.470 --> 00:15:03.640
Grandpa!

159
00:15:03.640 --> 00:15:08.420
Why do you want me to fight with these guys?!

160
00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:15.230
That's your training!

161
00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:16.870
My training?!

162
00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:21.160
It just makes me hungry and I
don't wanna get hit anymore!

163
00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:26.030
Don't be such a baby!

164
00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:29.280
You've got to become the strongest Navy soldier!

165
00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:33.640
I'm gonna become a pirate,
not a Navy soldier!

166
00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:37.420
Huh?

167
00:15:37.960 --> 00:15:39.970
You fool!

168
00:15:39.970 --> 00:15:41.870
Ouch!

169
00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:45.560
Nothing's more painful than Grandpa's fist!

170
00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:54.290
I can't do it, Grandpa! Move out of my way!

171
00:15:54.290 --> 00:15:57.500
If you can't, Ace will die!

172
00:15:57.500 --> 00:15:59.180
No way!

173
00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:03.770
Things don't always go as you want!
I'm not gonna have mercy on you!

174
00:16:04.840 --> 00:16:06.800
Luffy, I consider you...

175
00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:11.710
my enemy!

176
00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:52.040
Garp!

177
00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:28.780
Dammit! What's wrong with me?! This isn't the time to...

178
00:17:29.430 --> 00:17:33.100
Pops, my brother and my crew...

179
00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:35.860
are falling, and yet...

180
00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:41.470
I'm so happy... my tears won't stop...

181
00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:46.040
Even now that it's come
to this... I want to live...

182
00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:57.960
Vice Admiral Garp!

183
00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:08.730
You're their parent after all, Garp.

184
00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:14.460
He is about to get to the scaffold!

185
00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:19.340
You called him a reckless piece of crap!

186
00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:21.940
He is reckless!

187
00:18:21.940 --> 00:18:25.680
I wonder how he will free Fire Fist Ace.

188
00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:28.750
Get lost! You fool!

189
00:18:35.780 --> 00:18:37.800
You're not careful.

190
00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:39.950
Pops!

191
00:18:58.470 --> 00:18:59.110
Take this.

192
00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:03.000
This is the key to your brother's handcuffs.

193
00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.320
I have the key!

194
00:19:06.860 --> 00:19:08.680
Luffy, you...

195
00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:35.450
Wh-What the hell is that?!

196
00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:41.670
Look! Fleet Admiral Sengoku is using his power!

197
00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:42.950
I've never seen it before!

198
00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:47.000
You can't get away from me!

199
00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:56.630
Sengoku!

200
00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:57.740
A giant Buddha!

201
00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:07.180
I can't believe that you even have
such a thing, Straw Hat Luffy!

202
00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:11.320
Oh no, the key!

203
00:20:11.320 --> 00:20:12.550
Get ready!

204
00:20:13.590 --> 00:20:16.280
Aim at them and be ready to
fire at a moment's notice!

205
00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:19.400
No way, the key...!

206
00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:23.000
Straw Hat Luffy!

207
00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:26.100
You're a serious criminal who
should be punished by death, too!

208
00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:33.000
I'm gonna execute both of you
brothers with my own bare hands!

209
00:20:40.190 --> 00:20:44.050
What was that? I passed
out all of a sudden...

210
00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:49.090
Straw Hat... Oh!

211
00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:52.700
Three! Why are you here?!

212
00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:02.530
What is that?!

213
00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:05.640
Hey, Three! Protect Ace with a wall!

214
00:21:05.640 --> 00:21:07.830
Rubber-Rubber...

215
00:21:09.650 --> 00:21:12.490
Giant Balloon!

216
00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:18.150
Candle Wall!

217
00:21:22.060 --> 00:21:23.590
Is he expanding?!

218
00:21:34.400 --> 00:21:36.580
The scaffold is collapsing!

219
00:21:36.580 --> 00:21:37.840
What happened?!

220
00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:40.640
Ace is still alive!

221
00:21:40.640 --> 00:21:42.650
We're falling!

222
00:21:43.730 --> 00:21:48.080
I'll make the key! Uncuff him right away!

223
00:21:48.960 --> 00:21:50.280
Alright!

224
00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:53.510
Captain Buggy! There's Brother Three!

225
00:21:53.510 --> 00:21:58.050
What?! What is he doing in
that ridiculous costume?!

226
00:21:58.590 --> 00:22:01.370
I thought he ran away from here already!

227
00:22:05.990 --> 00:22:09.660
Where's the other guy?!
What's taking him so long?!

228
00:22:09.660 --> 00:22:13.570
Since it was such short notice, he's
having trouble getting ready...

229
00:22:13.570 --> 00:22:15.820
Hey, hurry up!

230
00:22:15.820 --> 00:22:17.490
Alright, let's go!

231
00:22:25.080 --> 00:22:31.570
If I tell you that I'm here out
of respect for my late comrade,

232
00:22:31.570 --> 00:22:34.430
are you going to laugh at me?!

233
00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:37.480
No, I won't!

234
00:22:37.480 --> 00:22:41.190
Fire! Blow them away!

235
00:22:43.520 --> 00:22:45.620
Save your brother, Straw Hat!

236
00:22:46.020 --> 00:22:47.340
Okay!

237
00:22:48.900 --> 00:22:50.250
Oh no!

238
00:23:01.540 --> 00:23:03.240
Straw Hat-boy!

239
00:23:03.240 --> 00:23:04.500
No way!

240
00:23:04.500 --> 00:23:06.880
Ace!

241
00:23:09.110 --> 00:23:10.750
Brother Three!

242
00:23:10.750 --> 00:23:12.980
They all got hit!

243
00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:17.350
Fire Fist can't use his power because of
the seastone handcuffs!

244
00:23:17.350 --> 00:23:18.700
He's dead!

245
00:23:18.700 --> 00:23:21.230
And we got Straw Hat, too!

246
00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:40.280
There's a tunnel of fire in the smoke!

247
00:23:41.050 --> 00:23:43.540
You've always been like this!

248
00:23:43.880 --> 00:23:45.400
Luffy!

249
00:23:48.660 --> 00:23:51.350
You've never even listened to me...

250
00:23:56.370 --> 00:23:59.970
and always done such crazy things!

251
00:24:01.350 --> 00:24:02.400
Good!

252
00:24:02.400 --> 00:24:03.250
Oh my!

253
00:24:03.250 --> 00:24:05.580
Ace!

254
00:24:05.580 --> 00:24:08.280
I-I can't believe it!

255
00:24:08.280 --> 00:24:11.340
Straw Hat and Brother Three are alive, too!

256
00:24:21.890 --> 00:24:25.380
Ace!
